{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nuclear war on the horizon, you have been selected to join <strong>Base Seed-0</strong>, humanity\u2019s first lunar refuge. Others will follow, but you are among the first to depart. Your presence ensures the station is ready in case the Earth is no longer safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your duty. This is our survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Directorate of Human Continuity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/135780e940b53e90f385c1b2626c47ab.poster.avif?t=1757451447\" width=960 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/135780e940b53e90f385c1b2626c47ab.webm?t=1757451447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/135780e940b53e90f385c1b2626c47ab.mp4?t=1757451447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500 years after nuclear war collapsed the Earth, you wake up from cryogenic sleep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/c2edde87e86f508b67d8bbeeeda410ab.avif?t=1757451447\" width=1224 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You descend into the southern hemisphere, where native forests reclaim the land, rivers carve through broken highways, and scattered ruins hint at the lives once lived here. Even tho this region was't a direct target of the first missiles, few survivors remain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/cac862b8e5855549b648a296d64c1d4e.avif?t=1757451447\" data-has-big width=1560 height=494 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP or PVP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6bc0b1c3cb54f0b488f06814c2f3c9a5.poster.avif?t=1757451447\" width=960 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6bc0b1c3cb54f0b488f06814c2f3c9a5.webm?t=1757451447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/6bc0b1c3cb54f0b488f06814c2f3c9a5.mp4?t=1757451447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend with local multiplayer</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE &amp; TRADE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/3a3b0c8ae81bfe5e00565d87ebf8ab20.avif?t=1757451447\" data-has-big width=1560 height=494 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting resources  help  improve your gear and vehicles for your mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYSTERY &amp; POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781420/extras/eaa4928a272da429e9f501641c41015f.avif?t=1757451447\" data-has-big width=1600 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryptic messages guide you toward strange powers that could change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage